This cartridge generates an sql based on a csv.

ticket: LOGON-7031

input: a list of business partner ids to be deleted
output: a script which fully deletes all these business partners

naming:

- the generated sql file will be located in a directory according to
the parent directory-name of the path in which the csv file resides
- the generated sql files will be named according to the input-csv
file with '.csv' replaced by '.sql'.

in:    csv/deleteBp/deleteBp.csv
out:   outputdir/deleteBp/deleteBp.sql
